WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.398 --> 00:00:02.278
- [Voiceover] Warning!

00:00:02.278 --> 00:00:05.528
Fiercely caffeinated, highly addictive.

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:09.778
World's strongest coffee.

00:00:09.778 --> 00:00:13.945
Today we found eight people
who have a death wish!

00:00:15.778 --> 00:00:16.958
- World's strongest coffee.

00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:18.000
That's totally bull--

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.650
- Are you gonna wish
you died or it's what's

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:21.656
gonna make you die?

00:00:21.656 --> 00:00:24.318
- Are they implying it's
enough caffeine to kill you?

00:00:24.318 --> 00:00:26.258
- [Voiceover] Just how
strong is this coffee?

00:00:26.258 --> 00:00:28.638
We took one mg of caffeine
and substituted it for

00:00:28.638 --> 00:00:30.878
one tablespoon of Death
Wish grounds so you

00:00:30.878 --> 00:00:32.318
can actually see it.

00:00:32.318 --> 00:00:33.151
The results:

00:00:33.151 --> 00:00:35.901
(dramatic music)

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:41.628
- You can try all you
want, you're not gonna

00:00:41.628 --> 00:00:43.099
make me afraid of beans.

00:00:43.099 --> 00:00:44.798
- I hate coffee, the end.

00:00:44.798 --> 00:00:45.770
- [Man] I like sugar.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:46.603
- [Woman] Coffee flavored milk.

00:00:46.603 --> 00:00:49.218
- Going to Taste Town.

00:00:49.218 --> 00:00:51.498
- Oh wow, this is amazing!

00:00:51.498 --> 00:00:53.473
- Just tastes like coffee.

00:00:53.473 --> 00:00:54.818
- Notes of bones.

00:00:54.818 --> 00:00:55.651
- And wood.

00:00:55.651 --> 00:00:56.667
- Hellfire.

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:57.698
- Nails.

00:00:57.698 --> 00:00:58.606
- Blood.

00:00:58.606 --> 00:01:00.638
- That's what that taste
is, it's Viking blood.

00:01:00.638 --> 00:01:04.798
- Wow, like I feel like
all my senses are like

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:06.031
elevated right now.

00:01:06.031 --> 00:01:07.696
- I'm drinking it without milk and I can

00:01:07.696 --> 00:01:08.604
drink this whole cup.

00:01:08.604 --> 00:01:10.638
- My heart is definitely
beating really fast right now.

00:01:10.638 --> 00:01:13.888
- I would wish Death coffee on anybody.

00:01:16.768 --> 00:01:19.616
- Oh, is this gonna give us diarrhea?

00:01:19.616 --> 00:01:22.598
- I'm home after work after
having two cups of it.

00:01:22.598 --> 00:01:25.238
I felt a lot of energy
running through my hands.

00:01:25.238 --> 00:01:27.798
- I'm here in the bathroom
and things are moving along

00:01:27.798 --> 00:01:30.418
really well and urgently.

00:01:30.418 --> 00:01:33.878
- It's around midnight
and I cannot fall asleep.

00:01:33.878 --> 00:01:35.518
- I usually like need two
or three cups of coffee to

00:01:35.518 --> 00:01:36.578
even really feel it.

00:01:36.578 --> 00:01:37.798
I'm definitely awake.

00:01:37.798 --> 00:01:39.500
- [Man] More Death Wish
coffee please, now!

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:40.838
How many times do I have to say it?

00:01:40.838 --> 00:01:41.956
- [Woman] Garret's pumped up!

